<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
    <title>アイヌ紋様 視線塗り絵</title>
    <style>
        * { box-sizing: border-box; user-select: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        body { font-family: "Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN", "Meiryo", sans-serif; background-color: #292524; color: #f5f5f4; height: 100vh; overflow: hidden; }

        .screen { display: none; flex-direction: column; height: 100vh; padding: 15px; position: relative; }
        .screen.active { display: flex; }

        /* 設定画面 */
        .setup-container { background: #44403c; border-radius: 20px; padding: 25px; max-width: 800px; margin: auto; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.5); width: 100%; max-height: 90vh; overflow-y: auto; color: #f5f5f4; }
        .setup-header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px; border-bottom: 3px solid #57534e; padding-bottom: 10px; }
        .setup-header h1 { font-size: 22pt; color: #fdba74; }

        .info-box { background: #57534e; padding: 15px; border-radius: 10px; margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; }
        .info-box strong { color: #fed7aa; }

        .section-title { font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; color: #fca5a5; margin: 15px 0 10px; }

        .setting-row { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 15px; background: #57534e; padding: 12px 18px; border-radius: 10px; }
        .setting-row label { font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; }
        .setting-row select, .setting-row input { padding: 8px 12px; font-size: 12pt; border-radius: 8px; border: none; background: #292524; color: white; }

        .btn { padding: 15px 25px; font-size: 16pt; font-weight: bold; color: white; border: none; border-radius: 12px; cursor: pointer; transition: background 0.2s; text-align: center; width: 100%; }
        .btn-primary { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #b91c1c, #1d4ed8); }
        .btn-primary:hover { opacity: 0.9; }

        /* カメラワイプ */
        .camera-container { position: absolute; top: 15px; right: 15px; width: 130px; height: 95px; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; border: 3px solid #fdba74; box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.5); z-index: 100; background: #000; }
        #webcam { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; transform: scaleX(-1); }

        /* 描画画面レイアウト */
        .art-header { display: flex; gap: 20px; justify-content: center; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-right: 140px; }
        
        .color-card { flex: 1; max-width: 300px; height: 70px; border-radius: 15px; border: 4px solid #57534e; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 10px; font-weight: bold; font-size: 16pt; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s; position: relative; overflow: hidden; background: #44403c; }
        .color-card.active { border-color: #fde047; transform: scale(1.05); box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(253, 224, 71, 0.6); }
        .color-preview { width: 35px; height: 35px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #fff; }
        .color-gauge { position: absolute; bottom: 0; left: 0; height: 8px; background-color: #fde047; width: 0%; transition: width 0.05s linear; }

        .canvas-container { flex: 1; position: relative; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; border: 4px solid #57534e; background-color: #f8f5e6; }
        #art-canvas { position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block; }
        #pattern-svg { position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; pointer-events: none; }

        .action-bar { display: flex; gap: 10px; position: absolute; bottom: 25px; left: 25px; z-index: 100; }
        .action-btn { padding: 10px 18px; font-size: 11pt; background-color: rgba(68, 64, 60, 0.9); color: white; border: 1px solid #78716c; font-weight: bold; border-radius: 10px; cursor: pointer; backdrop-filter: blur(5px); }
        .action-btn:hover { background-color: #b91c1c; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- 1. 設定画面 -->
    <div id="setup-screen" class="screen active">
        <div class="setup-container">
            <div class="setup-header">
                <h1>👘 アイヌ紋様 視線塗り絵</h1>
                <p style="color: #d6d3d1; margin-top: 5px;">目線で布に色を染めよう</p>
            </div>

            <div class="info-box">
                <strong>【学習のポイント】</strong><br>
                アイヌの着物（アットゥシなど）には、魔除けの意味を込めて独特の紋様が刺繍されました。<br>
                ・<strong>モレウ</strong>（渦巻き）：力が湧き出す、魔が目を回す<br>
                ・<strong>アイウシ</strong>（トゲ）：魔を刺して遠ざける
            </div>

            <div class="section-title">1. 染める色（2色）を選択</div>
            <div class="setting-row">
                <label for="color-left">👈 ひだりの色</label>
                <input type="color" id="color-left" value="#b91c1c">
            </div>
            <div class="setting-row">
                <label for="color-right">👉 みぎの色</label>
                <input type="color" id="color-right" value="#1e3a8a">
            </div>

            <div class="section-title">2. 感度・可動域の調整（感度不足を解消）</div>
            
            <div class="setting-row" style="border: 2px solid #fdba74;">
                <label for="gaze-sensitivity">🚀 感度（動きの大きさ）</label>
                <select id="gaze-sensitivity">
                    <option value="3.0">標準（少し動く）</option>
                    <option value="5.0" selected>高感度（よく動く・おすすめ）</option>
                    <option value="8.0">爆発感度（少しの目線で端まで届く）</option>
                    <option value="12.0">限界突破（わずかな動きで画面全域）</option>
                </select>
            </div>

            <div class="setting-row">
                <label for="head-assist">👤 顔の向きアシスト</label>
                <select id="head-assist">
                    <option value="0.5" selected>ON（目線＋顔の向きで塗る・おすすめ）</option>
                    <option value="0.0">OFF（目線のみ）</option>
                    <option value="1.0">強力（顔の傾きを大きく反映）</option>
                </select>
            </div>

            <div class="setting-row">
                <label for="brush-size">筆の太さ（塗りやすさ）</label>
                <select id="brush-size">
                    <option value="50">細め</option>
                    <option value="90" selected>標準（おすすめ）</option>
                    <option value="150">超太め（すぐ全体が塗れる）</option>
                </select>
            </div>

            <button id="start-btn" class="btn btn-primary" style="margin-top: 15px;">カメラを起動してスタート！</button>
            <p id="loading-msg" style="text-align: center; color: #fdba74; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 10px; display: none;">AIモデルを準備中...</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 2. 描画画面 -->
    <div id="presentation-screen" class="screen">
        <div class="camera-container">
            <video id="webcam" autoplay playsinline muted></video>
        </div>

        <div class="art-header">
            <div class="color-card active" id="color-card-0">
                <div class="color-preview" id="preview-0"></div>
                <span>👈 ひだり</span>
                <div class="color-gauge" id="gauge-0"></div>
            </div>

            <div class="color-card" id="color-card-1">
                <div class="color-preview" id="preview-1"></div>
                <span>👉 みぎ</span>
                <div class="color-gauge" id="gauge-1"></div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="canvas-container" id="canvas-wrapper">
            <canvas id="art-canvas"></canvas>
            
            <svg id="pattern-svg" viewBox="0 0 500 500" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet">
                <defs>
                    <g id="motif">
                        <path d="M 0,0 C 120,0 140,100 70,120 C 20,135 -20,80 10,40 C 35,10 70,20 60,60 C 55,80 35,70 30,50" fill="none" stroke="#1c1917" stroke-width="12" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                        <path d="M 135,90 L 170,70 M 135,90 L 160,125" fill="none" stroke="#1c1917" stroke-width="12" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                        <path d="M 70,120 L 60,160 M 70,120 L 100,150" fill="none" stroke="#1c1917" stroke-width="12" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                    </g>
                </defs>
                
                <g transform="translate(250, 250)">
                    <use href="#motif" transform="scale(1, 1)" />
                    <use href="#motif" transform="scale(-1, 1)" />
                    <use href="#motif" transform="scale(1, -1)" />
                    <use href="#motif" transform="scale(-1, -1)" />
                    <polygon points="0,-60 60,0 0,60 -60,0" fill="none" stroke="#1c1917" stroke-width="14" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                </g>

                <rect x="25" y="25" width="450" height="450" rx="20" fill="none" stroke="#1c1917" stroke-width="16"/>
                <rect x="70" y="70" width="360" height="360" rx="10" fill="none" stroke="#1c1917" stroke-width="8"/>
                
                <path d="M 70,160 L 35,140 M 70,160 L 35,180" fill="none" stroke="#1c1917" stroke-width="8" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                <path d="M 70,340 L 35,320 M 70,340 L 35,360" fill="none" stroke="#1c1917" stroke-width="8" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                <path d="M 430,160 L 465,140 M 430,160 L 465,180" fill="none" stroke="#1c1917" stroke-width="8" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                <path d="M 430,340 L 465,320 M 430,340 L 465,360" fill="none" stroke="#1c1917" stroke-width="8" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            </svg>
        </div>

        <div class="action-bar">
            <button id="clear-btn" class="action-btn">🗑️ 最初からやり直す</button>
            <button id="save-btn" class="action-btn">💾 作品を保存する</button>
            <button id="back-to-setup" class="action-btn">⚙️ 設定へ戻る</button>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script type="module">
        import { FaceLandmarker, FilesetResolver } from "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@mediapipe/tasks-vision@0.10.3";

        let faceLandmarker = null;
        let lastVideoTime = -1;
        let isCameraInit = false;

        let colors = ["#b91c1c", "#1e3a8a"];
        let currentColorIndex = 0;
        let brushSize = 90;
        let sensitivityMultiplier = 5.0;
        let headAssistWeight = 0.5;

        let currentTargetColor = -1;
        let dwellStartTime = null;
        const dwellTimeMs = 350;

        let currentX = 0;
        let currentY = 0;
        let baseNoseX = null;
        let baseNoseY = null;

        const ui = {
            colorLeft: document.getElementById('color-left'),
            colorRight: document.getElementById('color-right'),
            brushSizeSelect: document.getElementById('brush-size'),
            sensitivitySelect: document.getElementById('gaze-sensitivity'),
            headAssistSelect: document.getElementById('head-assist'),
            startBtn: document.getElementById('start-btn'),
            loadingMsg: document.getElementById('loading-msg'),
            setupScreen: document.getElementById('setup-screen'),
            presentationScreen: document.getElementById('presentation-screen'),
            backToSetupBtn: document.getElementById('back-to-setup'),
            clearBtn: document.getElementById('clear-btn'),
            saveBtn: document.getElementById('save-btn'),
            video: document.getElementById('webcam'),
            canvas: document.getElementById('art-canvas'),
            canvasWrapper: document.getElementById('canvas-wrapper')
        };

        const ctx = ui.canvas.getContext('2d');

        function resizeCanvas() {
            ui.canvas.width = ui.canvasWrapper.clientWidth;
            ui.canvas.height = ui.canvasWrapper.clientHeight;
            currentX = ui.canvas.width / 2;
            currentY = ui.canvas.height / 2;
            clearCanvas();
        }

        function clearCanvas() {
            ctx.fillStyle = "#f8f5e6";
            ctx.fillRect(0, 0, ui.canvas.width, ui.canvas.height);
        }

        ui.startBtn.addEventListener('click', async () => {
            colors[0] = ui.colorLeft.value;
            colors[1] = ui.colorRight.value;
            brushSize = parseInt(ui.brushSizeSelect.value);
            sensitivityMultiplier = parseFloat(ui.sensitivitySelect.value);
            headAssistWeight = parseFloat(ui.headAssistSelect.value);

            document.getElementById('preview-0').style.backgroundColor = colors[0];
            document.getElementById('preview-1').style.backgroundColor = colors[1];

            ui.startBtn.disabled = true;
            ui.loadingMsg.style.display = 'block';

            if (!isCameraInit) {
                await initAI();
            } else {
                startPresentation();
            }
        });

        async function initAI() {
            try {
                const filesetResolver = await FilesetResolver.forVisionTasks("https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@mediapipe/tasks-vision@0.10.3/wasm");
                
                faceLandmarker = await FaceLandmarker.createFromOptions(filesetResolver, {
                    baseOptions: { 
                        modelAssetPath: `https://storage.googleapis.com/mediapipe-models/face_landmarker/face_landmarker/float16/1/face_landmarker.task`, 
                        delegate: "CPU" 
                    },
                    outputFaceBlendshapes: true, runningMode: "VIDEO", numFaces: 1
                });

                const stream = await navigator.mediaDevices.getUserMedia({ video: { facingMode: "user" } });
                ui.video.srcObject = stream;
                await ui.video.play();

                isCameraInit = true;
                startPresentation();
                predictWebcam();
            } catch (err) {
                alert("カメラの読み込みに失敗しました。");
                ui.startBtn.disabled = false;
                ui.loadingMsg.style.display = 'none';
            }
        }

        function startPresentation() {
            ui.setupScreen.classList.remove('active');
            ui.presentationScreen.classList.add('active');
            ui.startBtn.disabled = false;
            ui.loadingMsg.style.display = 'none';
            baseNoseX = null;
            baseNoseY = null;
            setTimeout(resizeCanvas, 100);
        }

        function predictWebcam() {
            if (faceLandmarker && ui.presentationScreen.classList.contains('active')) {
                let startTimeMs = performance.now();
                
                if (ui.video.readyState >= 2 && lastVideoTime !== ui.video.currentTime) {
                    lastVideoTime = ui.video.currentTime;
                    const results = faceLandmarker.detectForVideo(ui.video, startTimeMs);

                    if (results.faceBlendshapes && results.faceBlendshapes.length > 0) {
                        const shapes = results.faceBlendshapes[0].categories;
                        
                        // 1. 目線ベクトルの取得
                        const lookLeft = (shapes.find(s => s.categoryName === "eyeLookOutLeft")?.score || 0) + (shapes.find(s => s.categoryName === "eyeLookInRight")?.score || 0);
                        const lookRight = (shapes.find(s => s.categoryName === "eyeLookInLeft")?.score || 0) + (shapes.find(s => s.categoryName === "eyeLookOutRight")?.score || 0);
                        const lookUp = (shapes.find(s => s.categoryName === "eyeLookUpLeft")?.score || 0) + (shapes.find(s => s.categoryName === "eyeLookUpRight")?.score || 0);
                        const lookDown = (shapes.find(s => s.categoryName === "eyeLookDownLeft")?.score || 0) + (shapes.find(s => s.categoryName === "eyeLookDownRight")?.score || 0);

                        let gazeDX = (lookRight - lookLeft);
                        let gazeDY = (lookDown - lookUp);

                        // 2. 顔の向き（頭の移動）のアシスト計算
                        let headDX = 0;
                        let headDY = 0;
                        if (results.faceLandmarks && results.faceLandmarks[0]) {
                            const nose = results.faceLandmarks[0][1]; // 鼻頭ランドマーク
                            if (baseNoseX === null) {
                                baseNoseX = nose.x;
                                baseNoseY = nose.y;
                            }
                            // カメラが反転しているためXの符号を調整
                            headDX = (baseNoseX - nose.x) * 4.0; 
                            headDY = (nose.y - baseNoseY) * 4.0;
                        }

                        // 3. 目線と顔向きを合成
                        let totalDX = gazeDX + (headDX * headAssistWeight);
                        let totalDY = gazeDY + (headDY * headAssistWeight);

                        // 4. 強力なブースト倍率の適用
                        const targetX = ui.canvas.width / 2 + (totalDX * ui.canvas.width * 0.8 * sensitivityMultiplier);
                        const targetY = ui.canvas.height / 2 + (totalDY * ui.canvas.height * 0.8 * sensitivityMultiplier);

                        // スムーズな補間（素早い追従のため 0.25 に引き上げ）
                        currentX += (targetX - currentX) * 0.25;
                        currentY += (targetY - currentY) * 0.25;

                        // 画面外に飛び出さないように制御
                        currentX = Math.max(0, Math.min(ui.canvas.width, currentX));
                        currentY = Math.max(0, Math.min(ui.canvas.height, currentY));

                        // 画面最上部（色選択カード領域）の注視チェック
                        if (targetY < 90) {
                            const colorZone = targetX < ui.canvas.width / 2 ? 0 : 1;
                            updateColorDwell(colorZone);
                        } else {
                            updateColorDwell(-1);
                            drawOnCanvas(currentX, currentY);
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
            requestAnimationFrame(predictWebcam);
        }

        function drawOnCanvas(x, y) {
            ctx.beginPath();
            ctx.arc(x, y, brushSize / 2, 0, Math.PI * 2);
            ctx.fillStyle = colors[currentColorIndex];
            ctx.globalAlpha = 0.55;
            ctx.fill();
            ctx.globalAlpha = 1.0;
        }

        function updateColorDwell(targetIndex) {
            if (targetIndex !== currentTargetColor) {
                resetGauges();
                currentTargetColor = targetIndex;
                dwellStartTime = targetIndex !== -1 ? performance.now() : null;
            } else if (targetIndex !== -1 && dwellStartTime) {
                const elapsed = performance.now() - dwellStartTime;
                const progress = Math.min(100, (elapsed / dwellTimeMs) * 100);

                const gauge = document.getElementById(`gauge-${targetIndex}`);
                if (gauge) gauge.style.width = `${progress}%`;

                if (elapsed >= dwellTimeMs) {
                    switchColor(targetIndex);
                }
            }
        }

        function resetGauges() {
            document.querySelectorAll('.color-gauge').forEach(g => g.style.width = '0%');
        }

        function switchColor(index) {
            currentColorIndex = index;
            document.querySelectorAll('.color-card').forEach((c, i) => {
                if (i === index) c.classList.add('active');
                else c.classList.remove('active');
            });
            resetGauges();
            dwellStartTime = null;
            currentTargetColor = -1;
        }

        ui.clearBtn.addEventListener('click', clearCanvas);

        ui.saveBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
            const exportCanvas = document.createElement('canvas');
            exportCanvas.width = ui.canvas.width;
            exportCanvas.height = ui.canvas.height;
            const exCtx = exportCanvas.getContext('2d');
            
            exCtx.drawImage(ui.canvas, 0, 0);

            const svgElement = document.getElementById('pattern-svg');
            const svgData = new XMLSerializer().serializeToString(svgElement);
            const svgString = svgData.replace('<svg', `<svg width="${ui.canvas.width}" height="${ui.canvas.height}"`);
            const blob = new Blob([svgString], { type: 'image/svg+xml;charset=utf-8' });
            const url = URL.createObjectURL(blob);
            
            const img = new Image();
            img.onload = () => {
                exCtx.drawImage(img, 0, 0);
                URL.revokeObjectURL(url);
                
                const link = document.createElement('a');
                link.download = `ainu-monyou-${new Date().toISOString().slice(0,10)}.png`;
                link.href = exportCanvas.toDataURL('image/png');
                link.click();
            };
            img.src = url;
        });

        ui.backToSetupBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
            ui.presentationScreen.classList.remove('active');
            ui.setupScreen.classList.active;
            ui.setupScreen.classList.add('active');
        });

        window.addEventListener('resize', () => {
            if (ui.presentationScreen.classList.contains('active')) {
                resizeCanvas();
            }
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>
